        "notes": "Depending on how well you did in round one, round two can go one of two ways. You can either:\nSnag  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) and  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) or\npick up  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) or  [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61), depending on the enemy tank.\n\nThese items help you to continue your get in and get out strat you did the round before, but allow you to spend a little more time in before needing to get out with the weapon lifesteam from  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1)\n\n [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is good if you're going against  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49),  [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d), or  [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) to get the shields gone faster.",
