        "created_at": "2025-08-06T01:30:25.378229+00:00",
        "notes": "Here is where you get to make a choice:\nIf you find yourself walking with someone, either your tank or other DPS, you can get  [Shared Siphon](item_2a1a58fb-fa85-4561-a337-d4a36aaa7f73) to help support them. \nIf you're going in it alone and want to keep being annoying in the backline, you can pick up  [Wraith Renewal](item_bcfde4e9-a18e-4169-bbfc-6439b7a2615a) to support  [Spirited to Slay](item_e11c7adb-70b7-4816-8e31-2c94c600bfd5), or  [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) to get the job done quicker.\n\nAs for items,  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is overall good for whatever you plan on doing. It gives you a little bit of everything and helps back up your ult, as well as  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for extra kick.\n\nIf there's a Mei, I suggest selling   [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) and getting  [Neverfrost](item_eabd1dd6-6839-4d2b-b226-016c088cca21)",
