        "notes": "In round 5, I usually pick up  [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) for the sheer fact that I'm going to be picking off the backline a bit less by now, and bullying down the other tank with my tank. However, if you want to keep being a annoying presence, [Ghosted](item_bacfcb1d-f655-4a22-9f04-621f8c49815d) gets the job done.\n\nIf you have the money  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is a great grab here. It lets you finish off enemies quicker with the 10% increase, and it gives you a boost in weapon power overall. \n\nIf you're hitting headshots,  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) and  [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) are perfect to either boost that crit damage, or apply reduced healing to force cooldowns.",
